WEBVTT

00:36.930 --> 00:38.600
Have you come to a decision?

00:44.230 --> 00:45.060
Yeah.

00:46.520 --> 00:49.440
Let's... return Sis... back to normal.

00:49.440 --> 00:52.030
Let's... return Sis... back to normal.

00:52.030 --> 00:53.780
Let's... return Sis... back to normal.

01:11.290 --> 01:17.710
hane ga shiroku hikari mabushiku tondeyuku

01:11.290 --> 01:17.710
White feathers gleam and fly away brightly

01:18.130 --> 01:24.760
kokoro dake nosete hoshii no ni

01:18.130 --> 01:24.760
Though I only want to set my heart on them

01:25.760 --> 01:32.020
tsumetai te wo nobasu todokanai... shitteru

01:25.760 --> 01:32.020
I extend my cold hands - They won't reach... I know

01:32.650 --> 01:39.740
dakedo ima furetai kimi ni

01:32.650 --> 01:39.740
But I want to touch you now

01:39.950 --> 01:45.870
natsukashii kaze ni ha ano koro no fune

01:39.950 --> 01:45.870
On that nostalgic wind - A ship from the past

01:46.280 --> 01:54.290
maboroshi ga omoide wo miseta

01:46.280 --> 01:54.290
An illusion showed me memories

01:55.360 --> 02:04.300
"wasurenai" dareka no koe ga setsunaku hibiku

01:55.360 --> 02:04.300
"I won't forget" Someone's voice echoes painfully

02:04.470 --> 02:09.390
hajimaru yokan ni furuete

02:04.470 --> 02:09.390
Trembling with a foreboding

02:09.680 --> 02:17.730
"wasuretai" negau jibun ga wakaranai

02:09.680 --> 02:17.730
"I want to forget" I cannot understand myself for hoping so

02:18.110 --> 02:27.450
matteiru yurarenagara yume hitotsu wo

02:18.110 --> 02:27.450
I shall wait while swaying, for that one dream

02:34.550 --> 02:39.260
Renga of Reverie

02:47.980 --> 02:49.310
No calls, huh.

03:07.580 --> 03:08.540
I'm home.

03:12.040 --> 03:12.960
Yorito...

03:14.340 --> 03:15.590
Where did you go?

03:17.670 --> 03:18.960
I met with Matsuri.

03:22.050 --> 03:23.640
What did she tell you?

03:24.050 --> 03:27.010
Everything you hid from me.

03:45.660 --> 03:46.830
Good morning, Sis.

03:48.040 --> 03:48.950
I'll help you.

03:57.040 --> 03:59.710
I want Sis to be happy.

04:00.170 --> 04:01.720
That's... my only wish.

04:01.720 --> 04:03.220
That's... my only wish.

04:06.260 --> 04:07.300
So...

04:08.600 --> 04:10.980
Let's leave this town.

04:17.650 --> 04:18.400
What is it?

04:19.820 --> 04:22.950
Can I believe what you said?

04:28.830 --> 04:29.450
Yeah.

04:30.330 --> 04:32.160
Let's start over again.

04:36.790 --> 04:37.290
Yes...

04:40.340 --> 04:41.760
So you're leaving this town?

04:41.760 --> 04:42.460
Yes.

04:42.800 --> 04:43.470
When?

04:43.800 --> 04:44.800
I don't know yet.

04:45.180 --> 04:46.550
But soon.

04:47.390 --> 04:48.760
I see.

04:48.760 --> 04:50.100
That's pretty sudden, isn't it?

04:50.390 --> 04:53.560
It was my idea to leave this place quickly.

04:54.850 --> 04:56.650
If I were to stay here,

04:57.060 --> 04:59.520
I might try to stop you.

05:05.570 --> 05:06.660
You're so kind.

05:08.910 --> 05:12.660
I just can't stay indifferent when someone is going to be sacrificed.

05:18.670 --> 05:19.880
What about that boy?

05:21.050 --> 05:22.550
He went back.

05:24.340 --> 05:25.970
Back to his normal life.

05:26.260 --> 05:26.970
I see.

05:28.970 --> 05:30.890
That must've been a hard choice.

05:41.110 --> 05:42.780
I need to go see Sis.

05:42.780 --> 05:43.530
Wait!

05:44.990 --> 05:46.400
I'll ask her personally,

05:47.400 --> 05:48.910
who she really is,

05:49.780 --> 05:51.080
and what I am.

05:52.120 --> 05:52.870
Wait!

06:10.390 --> 06:11.220
What's wrong?

06:13.720 --> 06:16.730
I think the teacher is really mad at you.

06:17.270 --> 06:20.230
He said, it's almost as if you're not coming to school at all.

06:21.230 --> 06:23.360
Today's a special day after all.

06:23.730 --> 06:24.650
Special?

06:24.860 --> 06:25.360
Yes.

06:26.150 --> 06:27.700
The air is fresh.

06:28.070 --> 06:30.530
That's why the sky is bluer than usual.

06:31.280 --> 06:32.120
Really?

06:32.700 --> 06:34.240
You'll understand what I mean in the evening.

06:34.910 --> 06:37.540
There'll be a vivid, burning sunset.

06:37.790 --> 06:39.120
I see.

06:41.790 --> 06:43.960
You know, thanks for what you did yesterday.

06:45.300 --> 06:47.300
Koyori was really delighted

06:47.670 --> 06:50.880
that you returned to your sister's place.

06:51.430 --> 06:53.720
I tasted her French toast.

06:54.600 --> 06:55.970
It was sweet, wasn't it?

06:56.430 --> 07:00.230
She makes it so sweet, it's almost as if she wants to kill you.

07:00.600 --> 07:01.900
But it was tasty.

07:01.900 --> 07:02.730
That's right.

07:11.950 --> 07:12.530
Say, about-

07:12.530 --> 07:13.070
Sorry.

07:14.780 --> 07:15.330
Yorito...

07:16.830 --> 07:19.330
Don't ask me anything.

07:19.910 --> 07:20.710
Why?

07:22.460 --> 07:24.250
Is it something you can't tell me?

07:27.210 --> 07:27.840
You know,

07:28.380 --> 07:32.130
I'm really quite adaptable in handling these situations.

07:34.010 --> 07:37.510
When I heard that Matsuri-san was a Yaka, I was fine with it, too.

07:37.850 --> 07:39.980
And I was calm when I learned all about your sister, as well.

07:40.270 --> 07:41.980
So whatever it is-

07:41.230 --> 07:41.980
I can't.

07:43.230 --> 07:44.060
Even so...

07:45.480 --> 07:46.400
I can't.

07:48.650 --> 07:50.860
Anyway, I'm fine.

07:52.450 --> 07:53.360
Got it.

07:53.780 --> 07:55.490
Then there's nothing I should worry about any more.

08:01.120 --> 08:02.160
Did you really think... I'd say something like that?

08:02.160 --> 08:03.210
Did you really think... I'd say something like that?

08:03.830 --> 08:04.750
Mana...

08:04.880 --> 08:07.380
Be more considerate of other people's feelings!

08:29.020 --> 08:29.940
Yorito?

08:31.860 --> 08:33.320
I-I'm sorry.

08:33.860 --> 08:35.990
I rang the bell, but...

08:38.830 --> 08:40.080
And then, and then...

08:40.240 --> 08:44.420
What do you think the bearded dandy said?

08:44.420 --> 08:46.420
We don't care; just take our orders.

08:46.420 --> 08:48.290
Forget that!

08:48.290 --> 08:50.380
Hey, c'mon, what do you think he said?

08:50.380 --> 08:54.300
He asked if we have take-out at night!

08:56.300 --> 08:58.930
Let's see... seafood <i>au gratin...</i>

08:59.930 --> 09:00.600
What about you, Chisato?

09:00.970 --> 09:04.270
A chocolate-strawberry parfait and a caramel pancake.

09:03.230 --> 09:04.270
Hey...

09:04.480 --> 09:06.400
Hey, are you guys listening?

09:05.310 --> 09:07.690
That's a scary order since it'll show up on the scales.

09:08.270 --> 09:08.860
What about you, Mana?

09:10.400 --> 09:11.110
Mana?

09:12.030 --> 09:12.990
Anything is fine.

09:13.400 --> 09:14.360
What's wrong?

09:14.610 --> 09:17.160
You're acting weird today. Did something happen?

09:17.820 --> 09:18.990
Could it be...?

09:19.320 --> 09:20.330
Knock it off.

09:20.620 --> 09:22.660
I don't want to hear Yorito's name today.

09:24.620 --> 09:25.620
Yorito?

09:25.620 --> 09:26.420
Who's...

09:26.580 --> 09:27.500
...that?

09:29.210 --> 09:31.250
I'm not in the mood for jokes!

09:31.420 --> 09:32.380
Forget it!

09:34.170 --> 09:34.760
Hey, wait...

09:37.840 --> 09:39.180
Mana...

09:44.810 --> 09:45.770
Go home.

09:47.230 --> 09:49.270
Don't come here any more.

09:49.440 --> 09:50.230
Um...

09:50.520 --> 09:52.150
We're leaving this town,

09:52.440 --> 09:54.110
so it's better if we don't meet any more.

09:55.400 --> 09:59.950
Does that mean you're moving away?

10:01.200 --> 10:02.740
Where to?

10:03.200 --> 10:04.040
Far away.

10:05.120 --> 10:08.710
Far away; where the memories of our past can't reach us.

10:14.710 --> 10:17.470
IKEDA BOOKSTORE

10:19.680 --> 10:21.050
It's delicious.

10:21.050 --> 10:23.850
As expected from a place famous for their seafood.

10:23.850 --> 10:24.890
I wouldn't know.

10:24.890 --> 10:26.640
I've only had their meat dishes so far.

10:27.680 --> 10:28.980
I see.

10:30.650 --> 10:31.310
Mayuko.

10:32.610 --> 10:33.770
I got the tickets.

10:34.070 --> 10:34.940
We're leaving this town.

10:35.110 --> 10:35.780
When?

10:36.400 --> 10:37.150
Tonight.

10:41.820 --> 10:42.620
Takeshi.

10:44.050 --> 10:45.180
You're a jerk!

10:47.500 --> 10:48.870
Why?

10:48.870 --> 10:49.870
You're a jerk!

10:50.120 --> 10:51.580
Two times, huh?

11:04.140 --> 11:07.020
Don't ask me anything.

11:07.520 --> 11:08.730
Why... did he say that?

11:08.730 --> 11:09.810
Why... did he say that?

11:13.150 --> 11:15.020
It really is beautiful.

11:15.520 --> 11:17.820
Everything seems to be dyed in orange hues.

11:19.490 --> 11:21.660
He feels so far away from me.

11:25.330 --> 11:26.290
Sorry.

11:31.250 --> 11:32.710
Sorry for what happened earlier.

11:33.080 --> 11:35.090
I was just a bit irritated.

11:36.340 --> 11:37.550
It's fine.

11:37.840 --> 11:41.380
Chisato was really shocked, and Sae even cried.

11:41.380 --> 11:43.090
I didn't know what to do.

11:43.890 --> 11:44.720
I see.

11:45.100 --> 11:46.430
I'll apologize to them tomorrow.

11:46.430 --> 11:49.600
Well, I don't think you should worry about it too much.

11:51.980 --> 11:55.770
Say, what do you think of Yorito?

11:55.770 --> 11:56.770
Yorito?

11:56.770 --> 11:57.400
Yeah.

11:58.110 --> 11:59.110
Somehow... I don't understand him any more.

11:59.110 --> 12:00.990
Somehow... I don't understand him any more.

12:01.570 --> 12:02.240
He's-

12:02.240 --> 12:02.900
Who's that?

12:04.160 --> 12:06.410
You said that name earlier, too.

12:06.410 --> 12:07.580
What do you mean, "who's that"?!

12:07.580 --> 12:09.490
I'm talking about Yorito. Morimiya Yorito!

12:09.700 --> 12:11.750
Morimiya Yorito?

12:12.040 --> 12:13.710
C'mon, our classmate.

12:13.710 --> 12:16.670
He always skips class and shoots photos of the sky.

12:16.920 --> 12:17.960
Mana... are you all right?

12:17.960 --> 12:18.920
Mana... are you all right?

12:19.210 --> 12:20.510
There's no one like that in our class.

12:20.800 --> 12:23.590
Chisato and I were wondering what that was about, too.

12:24.720 --> 12:26.510
Wait a minute. What are you talking about?

12:26.850 --> 12:28.640
I'm talking about Yorito. You know, Yorito.

12:30.350 --> 12:31.100
Here!

12:31.350 --> 12:33.270
I have a picture of him-

12:35.310 --> 12:35.900
Where?

12:39.400 --> 12:40.190
No way...

12:51.290 --> 12:54.290
Are you worried about that boy?

12:55.920 --> 12:57.000
I don't know.

13:00.670 --> 13:01.590
It's about time.

13:18.270 --> 13:19.610
Why did you come back?

13:19.610 --> 13:21.860
Aono-san, I have a favor to ask you.

13:22.280 --> 13:24.860
Please, teach me more origami.

13:25.780 --> 13:26.610
Koyori...

13:26.820 --> 13:28.910
Please, it's just for today.

13:32.200 --> 13:33.080
Come in.

13:36.080 --> 13:38.080
I'm very grateful.

13:49.890 --> 13:51.720
Today's a special day after all.

13:51.930 --> 13:53.520
You'll understand what I mean in the evening.

13:53.850 --> 13:56.060
There'll be a vivid, burning sunset.

14:05.530 --> 14:06.240
Sorry.

14:06.950 --> 14:08.990
Don't ask me anything.

14:24.670 --> 14:26.470
Anyway, I'm fine.

14:56.540 --> 14:57.620
Yorito...

15:05.500 --> 15:07.170
How's this?

15:07.170 --> 15:08.340
Three stars.

15:08.340 --> 15:09.840
Really?

15:10.220 --> 15:12.090
Um, and then...

15:12.090 --> 15:13.300
So the next one is...

15:16.890 --> 15:17.680
Koyori.

15:17.680 --> 15:18.730
What is it?

15:19.810 --> 15:21.140
I'm sorry.

15:22.150 --> 15:23.980
It can't be helped.

15:25.270 --> 15:26.150
Thank you.

15:27.400 --> 15:28.690
It's okay.

15:28.900 --> 15:30.700
I'm a good girl after all.

15:39.960 --> 15:40.910
It's beautiful.

15:41.290 --> 15:41.960
Isn't it?

15:42.540 --> 15:43.040
Yeah.

15:43.790 --> 15:47.840
So many different red hues are melting into the sky.

15:48.300 --> 15:50.880
That's why the sky is never the same twice.

15:51.340 --> 15:55.100
Even if they seem identical, they're all different skies.

15:59.680 --> 16:00.520
Yorito.

16:03.440 --> 16:05.440
It is you, right?

16:06.060 --> 16:07.690
You're Morimiya Yorito, right?

16:17.580 --> 16:18.450
Take my hand.

16:20.160 --> 16:20.950
Please.

16:28.460 --> 16:31.760
You're right here, aren't you?

16:32.420 --> 16:33.630
Of course.

16:34.430 --> 16:35.800
You're not a ghost,

16:36.010 --> 16:37.300
and you can hold my hand,

16:37.680 --> 16:38.810
and you have your own shadow.

16:39.260 --> 16:40.350
What's wrong with you?

16:40.560 --> 16:41.850
You've been forgotten.

16:42.810 --> 16:43.980
Chisato... Touko... Sae...

16:43.980 --> 16:44.560
Chisato... Touko... Sae...

16:44.560 --> 16:45.440
Chisato... Touko... Sae...

16:45.770 --> 16:47.310
Everyone has forgotten you.

16:48.820 --> 16:50.980
That should be impossible, yet...

16:52.740 --> 16:54.450
It's not possible, is it?

16:58.700 --> 17:00.450
Please, say something.

17:02.120 --> 17:03.960
Give me an answer!

17:07.710 --> 17:09.880
Let's see... the next one is...

17:09.880 --> 17:10.800
Koyori.

17:11.590 --> 17:13.380
Please, teach me more.

17:14.220 --> 17:17.050
Just a little longer...

17:18.600 --> 17:19.970
This is... the end.

17:19.970 --> 17:20.510
This is... the end.

17:20.810 --> 17:22.270
Why?

17:22.600 --> 17:24.940
You said we were friends...

17:27.230 --> 17:29.150
Koyori, you are my friend.

17:29.150 --> 17:32.400
Then don't leave!

17:33.280 --> 17:34.240
I want...

17:34.490 --> 17:35.200
I want...

17:35.610 --> 17:38.030
I want you to stay close to me forever and ever!

17:38.280 --> 17:39.120
Please understand.

17:39.870 --> 17:41.370
You're a good girl.

17:41.620 --> 17:43.790
I don't want to understand!

17:43.790 --> 17:44.910
I don't want to...

17:45.370 --> 17:46.710
I don't... want to...

17:46.710 --> 17:47.370
I don't... want to...

17:49.290 --> 17:51.040
I don't want to be... a good girl.

17:51.040 --> 17:52.130
I don't want to be... a good girl.

18:01.350 --> 18:03.430
Tomorrow morning, I'll come pick you up.

18:03.640 --> 18:04.430
Mana...

18:05.180 --> 18:08.770
The three of us will go to school together.

18:09.400 --> 18:12.520
You'll be gazing at the sky while we're in class,

18:12.520 --> 18:14.280
and you'll end up getting scolded by the teacher.

18:14.690 --> 18:18.320
When the bell rings, you'll rush to the roof with your camera,

18:18.820 --> 18:22.280
and with a weary face I'll come up to call you in...

18:22.910 --> 18:24.620
I won't forget that.

18:25.370 --> 18:26.960
I won't!

18:27.830 --> 18:29.710
No matter how much you wish for it,

18:29.710 --> 18:31.170
no matter how much you desire it...

18:31.170 --> 18:32.710
I won't forget you!

18:34.090 --> 18:35.380
I definitely... won't forget you!

18:35.380 --> 18:36.670
I definitely... won't forget you!

18:46.020 --> 18:46.850
I...

19:01.740 --> 19:04.660
Illusions are like reveries.

19:07.370 --> 19:09.910
They definitely existed there,

19:10.460 --> 19:11.960
but once you wake up from your dream,

19:12.460 --> 19:15.380
they fade from your memories.

19:27.680 --> 19:28.480
Where am I?

19:32.310 --> 19:34.650
Why am I crying?

19:36.980 --> 19:38.400
Why... won't the tears stop coming out?

19:38.400 --> 19:40.400
Why... won't the tears stop coming out?

19:51.960 --> 19:53.290
This is farewell.

19:53.670 --> 19:55.420
Why are you trying to act cool?

19:55.420 --> 19:56.540
Isn't it a bit late for that?

19:56.880 --> 19:57.800
Yeah,

19:58.510 --> 19:59.800
I looked bad.

20:00.260 --> 20:01.130
It's okay.

20:01.130 --> 20:02.300
I don't mind.

20:03.760 --> 20:06.140
Are you really fine with that?

20:06.850 --> 20:07.510
Yes.

20:07.720 --> 20:10.230
It's a decision I made with Yorito after all.

20:12.020 --> 20:13.810
Whenever you mention his name,

20:13.810 --> 20:15.520
I can read the hesitation on your face.

20:16.150 --> 20:17.070
I'm kidding.

20:20.240 --> 20:22.610
At least, don't have any regrets.

20:23.700 --> 20:24.570
Thanks.

20:26.700 --> 20:27.910
It's time to go.

20:29.660 --> 20:30.700
Good-bye then.

20:30.910 --> 20:31.700
Yes... good-bye.

20:31.700 --> 20:32.460
Yes... good-bye.

20:38.170 --> 20:42.260
Maybe I'm lucky not to be alone.

20:45.970 --> 20:46.760
Takeshi.

20:48.680 --> 20:50.390
What a troublesome princess.

20:52.600 --> 20:53.600
You're a jerk.

21:32.850 --> 21:33.850
Yorito?

21:41.900 --> 21:42.860
Aono.

21:52.790 --> 21:53.750
Matsuri.

22:14.350 --> 22:23.020
iro aseta page no kioku hitomi tojireba yomigaeru

22:14.350 --> 22:23.020
Memories on a faded page, they revive when I close my eyes

22:23.440 --> 22:32.200
adokenai shoujo no inori
habatakeyo kibou no sora he

22:23.440 --> 22:32.200
Prayers of an innocent girl
Fly away to the sky of hope

22:32.320 --> 22:36.620
nageku mamonaku  toki wa nagareru

22:32.320 --> 22:36.620
With no time to regret, time will flow

22:36.910 --> 22:41.710
hitori tachidomaru kedo

22:36.910 --> 22:41.710
Even though I stand alone

22:42.960 --> 22:48.470
yume mamoru shirabe  kuchizu samuno

22:42.960 --> 22:48.470
A tune to protect your dreams, I sing to myself

22:48.630 --> 22:52.970
hitobito ga nemuri ni tsukeba

22:48.630 --> 22:52.970
When people go into slumber

22:53.180 --> 23:00.890
mata au hi no negai tsumugeru deshou  ai no ito

22:53.180 --> 23:00.890
Their wish to unite can be woven. The thread of love

23:01.190 --> 23:11.320
yasashisa wo sasou  otogibanashi anata kara osowatta no yo

23:01.190 --> 23:11.320
Fairy tales that elicit kindness I learned that from you

23:11.490 --> 23:21.250
modorimashou  sotto ano koro no omoi ni

23:11.490 --> 23:21.250
Let us return gently to the memories of those times

23:31.010 --> 23:46.030
Next Time

23:31.010 --> 23:46.030
The Boundary between Light and Dark

23:31.590 --> 23:34.100
You don't seem to be child-like enough.

23:34.100 --> 23:36.930
Rather, you're the one who doesn't act like a child, Mayuko-san.

23:36.930 --> 23:38.100
I'm fine just the way I am.

23:38.100 --> 23:39.100
Why is that?

23:39.100 --> 23:40.480
Since I'm not a child.

23:40.480 --> 23:42.520
I'm no longer a child, either.

23:42.520 --> 23:44.270
That's not the issue here.

23:44.270 --> 23:45.320
Then what is?

23:45.320 --> 23:46.020
Well...
